            "image_loading": "",
            "title": "3 Speed Settings",
            "text": "<p>Tailor the airflow to your workout intensity with three speed settings. Choose from 349, 433, or 518 cubic feet per minute, with a maximum fan speed of 1300 RPM, to match your training needs. </p>",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "card_p3THhR": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Cardio54_Gym_Fan_AM1202R_VESA_Wall.webp",
            "image_loading": "",
            "title": "Seamless Wall Mounting",
            "text": "<p>The included VESA-compatible mounting adaptor enables easy wall installation, allowing you to position your Cardio54® Fan alongside your monitor or TV for a streamlined setup. The mounting options now allow for the fan to be positioned in a vertical orientation for whole body cooling. For full versatility, a mounting arm with rotation, tilt, and swivel adjustments is required. (VESA wall mount not included). </p>",
            "url": ""
          }
        }
      },
