            "image_loading": "",
            "title": "Tripod Mounting Option",
            "text": "<p>The Vacmaster Cardio54® features a mounting adaptor compatible with standard tripod threads, allowing flexible fan placement at various heights and angles. This setup elevates the airflow above floor level, enhancing cooling efficiency and targeted airflow. For optimal use, a tripod with a minimum payload capacity of 6 kg is required (tripod not included).</p>",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "card_iFAinj": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Cardio54_Gym_Fan_AM1202R_Targeted_Airflow.webp",
            "image_loading": "",
            "title": "Targeted Airflow",
            "text": "<p>3 adjustable positions straight out of the box are designed to target airflow towards your legs, core or head for tailored, personal cooling. Angle the fan at 0°, 45° & 90°.</p>",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "card_ya3g6x": {
